{"task_id": "HumanEval/49", "solution": "def modp(n: int, p: int):\n    \"\"\"Return 2^n modulo p using binary exponentiation.\n    This handles large integers efficiently.\n    \"\"\"\n    res = 1\n    base = 2 % p\n\n    while n > 0:\n        if n % 2 == 1:\n            res = (res * base) % p\n        base = (base * base) % p\n        n //= 2\n    return res"}
